{"id": "lululemon-2026-10-06-034", "date": "2026-10-06", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lululemon", "nike"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["leading"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.85, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "The Nature Conservancy Launches Microfiber Action Alliance To Reduce Microfiber Pollution In Textile Sector", "content": "SACRAMENTO, CA— October 6, 2026 — The Nature Conservancy (TNC) has launched the Microfiber Action Alliance (MAA), a new multi-stakeholder initiative to combat microfiber pollution by accelerating the adoption and scaling of effective, evidence-based solutions. Convened by TNC, the founding cohort includes Nike, Patagonia, Under Armour, lululemon, Cotopaxi and REI Co-op, among other leading brands. [&#8230;]", "sources": [{"name": "textile_world", "url": "https://www.textileworld.com/textile-world/2026/10/the-nature-conservancy-launches-microfiber-action-alliance-to-reduce-microfiber-pollution-in-textile-sector/", "type": "rss"}]}
